  (text_box "Description: Signal Map - STM32H743 Peripheral Assignments. Cross-reference tying every subsystem net to its MCU pin function. Fuel gauge on I²C1 (+ ALRT on EXTI6); BLE module on SPI4 (+ IRQ on EXTI5); six rotary encoders split across three timer-encoder channels (ENC1-3 on TIM1/2/3 CH1/CH2) and GPIO/EXTI (ENC4-6, with A on EXTI, B polled, SW on EXTI); DAC1_OUT1/OUT2 for vertical offsets; ADC12_INP3/INP4 for the two fast acquisition channels; USB D±. This sheet documents the pin-level netlist used for the acquisition MCU."
    (at 177.8 147.32 0) (size 104.14 15.24)
    (stroke (width 0) (type default))
    (fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) bold) (justify left top))
    (uuid b7f0cc2b-a049-4d3e-b94b-7c05e66623bc)
  )

